00005000</span>5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a></b>, Turn in at <a href=\"/page/Euphonia%27s_Hat_Box\" title=\"Euphonia&#39;s Hat Box\">Euphonia's Hat Box</a>; <b><a href=\"/page/DDO_Store\" title=\"DDO Store\">DDO Store</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove_loot#Hats\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove loot\">Treasure of Crystal Cove Hat Upgrades</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Scallawag%27s_Luck\" title=\"Scallawag&#39;s Luck\">Scallawag's Luck IV</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Scallawag%27s_Luck\" title=\"Scallawag&#39;s Luck\">Scallawag's Luck IV</a>:</b> While in Smuggler's Rest, you gain 25% additional doubloons when fighting pirates.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enchantable:_Crystal_Rush\" title=\"Enchantable: Crystal Rush\">Enchantable: Crystal Rush</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enchantable:_Crystal_Rush\" title=\"Enchantable: Crystal Rush\">Enchantable: Crystal Rush</a>:</b> This hat can be enchanted to bestow one of various benefits to nearby kobolds in Crystal Cove.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enchantable:_Adventuring_Bonus\" title=\"Enchantable: Adventuring Bonus\">Enchantable: Adventuring Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enchantable:_Adventuring_Bonus\" title=\"Enchantable: Adventuring Bonus\">Enchantable: Adventuring Bonus</a>:</b> This hat can be enchanted to bestow one of various benefits useful in general adventuring.  Adventuring effects may change the minimum level of this item.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enchantable:_Skilled_Seaman\" title=\"Enchantable: Skilled Seaman\">Enchantable: Skilled Seaman</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enchantable:_Skilled_Seaman\" title=\"Enchantable: Skilled Seaman\">Enchantable: Skilled Seaman</a>:</b> This hat can be enchanted to grant a bonus to one skill.  You can have one skill bonus on a hat at a time, but can replace it with a different choice.  Skill effects may change the minimum level of this item.</span></span></li></ul></dd></dl>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Captain%27s_Chapeau.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Captain%27s_Chapeau.png/420px-Captain%27s_Chapeau.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"364\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Captain%27s_Chapeau.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>You've certainly earned the feather in your cap.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p>May be obtained with an invitation to the <a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a> anniversary event, or purchased using barter items during the event.  Item may be dyed using the barter box in the <a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a> anniversary event.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817201855\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.103 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2814/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20910/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6526/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n153.30%  131.015     40 Template:IO\n100.00%   85.462      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   85.462      1 -total\n 96.71%   82.652      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 51.43%   43.954      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 50.44%   43.106      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 49.41%   42.223      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 48.26%   41.241      2 Template:InCategory\n 24.61%   21.033      6 Template:Popup\n 19.52%   16.684      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:14517-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817201855 and revision id 628879. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
